arbeitnow:commercial-account-executive-m:
&lt;div class="ace-line"&gt;
&lt;div class="ace-line" data-node-type="line"&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;As an Commercial Account Executive on our Commercial team you'll be responsible for seeking out new opportunities within both new logos and our existing customer base. You will have experience prospecting, running discovery calls/demos, negotiating, and a track record of closing new business. You should also understand use cases and how to sell across multiple departments and industries. To be successful in this role you will understand how to go after new business and build relationships with potential customers. Intrigued? We want to speak to you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU'LL DO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice="3 3 []"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage the entire sales cycle, which includes prospecting, conducting discovery calls and demos, negotiating deals, and closing new &amp;amp; existing business across all industries in the Small Medium Business segment (1-2000 employees).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct thorough research to understand your customers and prospects better. Gain insight into their unique business challenges and how Box can provide value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the sales process by influencing key stakeholders both internally and externally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop a comprehensive territory plan that covers all aspects of your target market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Schedule visits to meet customers face-to-face within your assigned territory if you feel appropriate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice="3 3 []"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German speaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years of experience in a sales role, with a proven track record of success - We're interested if you've been in inside sales too!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;Strong hunter with demonstrated pipeline generation creativity (events, social selling, automation tools).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;Skilled in qualification and deal progression frameworks (MEDDIC familiarity helpful; outcome-focused mindset essential).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity and eagerness to learn about Box’s product, new technologies, the industry, and your customer's businesses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear examples of successfully closing deals using an established sales process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effectively utilizes a repeatable method for identifying untapped opportunities and expanding into new territories&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous experience in building relationships and selling to executives at all level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week. Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based on current business needs, there is no relocation assistance provided for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box Benefits package includes 30 days of vacation, medical, and dental coverage. We have a robust wellness program including 30 days of vacation (plus your birthday off!) and subsidized gym membership. Boxers can also participate in our Employee Stock Purchase plan and other additional perks and benefits. Germany's office is based in a WeWork (Neuturmstrasse 5, Munich, BY 80331,) as well as other European offices across London, Paris, Amsterdam, and Warsaw.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href="https://cloud.app.box.com/s/dalfrm4h1m5wkjiq6171hbko9uwroulg" target="_blank" data-attrib-id="link-d0f4f175-3786-4719-8525-e15da4281b97"&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-software-engineer-fulls:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Fullstack Engineer (Go / Kotlin &amp;amp; React)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Merchant EMEA Engineering builds the technology that helps merchants join, grow, and operate successfully across our markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our organization brings together the strengths of Wolt and Deliveroo and supports merchants across 37 countries. We work across the merchant journey, including onboarding, business growth and support, analytics and recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, and merchant applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams sit close to the business. Rather than primarily building foundational platforms, we build products and features on top of our existing platforms to solve real merchant and market needs, including local business requirements, growth opportunities, and operational challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This open role is based in our tech hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Helsinki&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires being based in Berlin/Helsinki on a hybrid basis. We are currently unable to offer fully remote work, visa sponsorship, or relocation support for this opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Fullstack Engineer, you'll contribute to products and services used across the merchant experience.&amp;nbsp;You'll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain production software across backend services and user-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on areas such as merchant onboarding, analytics, recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, or merchant-facing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reliable APIs, data models, services, and user-facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, designers, operations, and other engineers to turn business needs into practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features from implementation through production and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design discussions and improve the quality, scalability, observability, and maintainability of our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively as part of your engineering workflow, while critically evaluating their output and taking ownership of the final solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to work outside your primary area of expertise when needed to solve the problem end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers take responsibility for the features and services they work on, from development to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; We work closely across engineering, product, design, data, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism:&lt;/strong&gt; We value simple and maintainable solutions that create business impact without unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We care more about solving the problem than strict frontend or backend boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our backend services primarily use &lt;strong&gt;Go and Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;, while our frontend applications use technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript and React&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also work with technologies including Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, gRPC, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're looking for engineers who have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset, with a deep experience in leveraging modern AI tools and solid engineering principles to solve problems end-to-end, independently of any specific technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building production software in backend, frontend, or fullstack environments end-to-end and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in at least one area of the stack, with a willingness to contribute outside that area when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a modern backend language such as Go, Kotlin, Java, or similar, and/or modern frontend technologies such as TypeScript and React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of APIs, databases, testing, and software design fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently on well-scoped problems and collaborate effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a pragmatic, collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; need to be equally strong in frontend and backend. We welcome different balances of experience. You might be primarily a backend engineer who is comfortable making frontend changes when needed, or a frontend-focused engineer who is happy to work with APIs and backend services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What matters most is that you are comfortable working across boundaries to deliver the right solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in one or more of the following areas would be a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Merchant-facing or internal operational tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, recommendations, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grocery, retail, restaurants, logistics, or marketplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrations with external business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or other streaming technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud infrastructure such as AWS, Kubernetes, or Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll work on products that directly affect how merchants interact with Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash across Europe. The scope is broad and close to the business, giving you the opportunity to work on meaningful problems across different parts of the merchant journey while developing your skills across the stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process here.&lt;a href="https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire"&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:engineering-manager-consumer-a:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What's in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the Deliveries squad at HelloFresh, you will lead the engineering vision and execution for how customers control their box week to week. Your squad owns the systems that keep a subscription flexing with the customer's life: skip, pause and resume, reschedule, delivery cadence, delivery day, and address changes — the controls a customer uses before an order locks in at cutoff — along with the home and delivery feed that surfaces them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivery planning is where correctness, resilience, and scale matter most: every change a customer makes must be applied accurately and in time before cutoff, and the platform must hold up at HelloFresh scale — around 7 million active customers across 18 countries, with close to 1 billion meals delivered a year. You and your team will work in a cross-functional squad with product, frontend, and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader who brings deep backend engineering judgement and is energised by collaborating across disciplines to make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don't “tick all the boxes” but think you'd thrive in this role, we'd really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and grow a cross-functional team of engineers (backend and frontend), ensuring smooth delivery and continuous improvement of the Deliveries systems and tech real estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and reliability of the delivery-control experience — skip, pause and resume, reschedule, cadence, delivery day, and address — with a strong focus on correctness, applying changes in time before cutoff, data integrity, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive design decisions for scalable, event-driven services (e.g., Kafka) that apply high volumes of delivery changes reliably, with the highest quality and resilience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as an engineering leader within a cross-functional squad: partner closely with product, frontend, and data to deliver end-to-end customer outcomes and make joint decisions across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion observability, on-call health, and incident readiness so delivery changes stay accurate and available around the clock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to hiring and capacity planning, conduct regular code reviews, and mentor engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a continuous improvement culture and promote the HelloFresh DNA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led a team in an agile environment (5+ engineers), ideally within a cross-functional squad setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 6+ years of hands-on backend development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building scalable microservices and event-driven systems (e.g., Kafka), especially where correctness, idempotency, and data consistency are critical — such as scheduling, subscription management, or other transactional domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating high-throughput backend systems that other teams and customer-facing surfaces depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps practices and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, Google Cloud), including observability and production ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and comfort working cross-functionally with product, frontend, and data partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an empathetic, strong communicator and active listener.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-organized individual who can operate autonomously, solve complex problems, and remove roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a humble leader who can motivate a team and drive them to their highest potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace "Learning Never Stops" with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:full-stack-engineer-contract-2:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style="max-width: 100%;" src="https://66degrees.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/JobPosting-Cover.jpg" alt="" width="1400"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Overview of 66degrees&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;66degrees is an end-to-end AI transformation partner that guides enterprises from complex business challenges to clear, quantifiable outcomes. Our company is the culmination of several successful firms, each a leader in its own right in cloud, artificial intelligence, and data. This convergence of talent and expertise is how we help businesses reach their own "inflection point," where chaotic data becomes a strategic asset, complexity becomes clarity, and AI becomes an engine for growth. Our ultimate vision is to be the catalyst for a future where every business operates as an intelligent enterprise, with autonomous systems unlocking human potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 66degrees, we believe in thriving through challenges and winning together. These values not only guide us in achieving our goals as a company but also for our people. We are dedicated to creating a significant impact for our employees by fostering a culture that sparks innovation and supports professional and personal growth along the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node="1"&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2"&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled Full Stack Engineer for a high-velocity, 12-week contract engagement. In this role, you will be responsible for building and deploying a modern, AI-integrated application hosted entirely on Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3"&gt;You will own the end-to-end development cycle, bridging a responsive React/TypeScript frontend with a high-performance Python/FastAPI backend. A core component of this project involves integrating Google's Vertex AI (Gemini models) to drive intelligent data extraction and risk assessment features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Stack Engineer (Contract)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="42"&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 12 Weeks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="61"&gt;Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt; 40 Hours per Week (Full-Time)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="103"&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; October 5th (Early October)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node="1"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node="4"&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="5"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Frontend Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build robust, highly responsive user interfaces using &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="87"&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="97"&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Backend &amp;amp; API Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and develop scalable backend services and RESTful APIs using &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="98"&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="113"&gt;FastAPI&lt;/strong&gt; framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Cloud-Native Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Containerise and deploy frontend and backend services utilising serverless &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="100"&gt;GCP Cloud Run&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Data Pipelining:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, deploy, and manage asynchronous data processing pipelines using &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,3,0" data-index-in-node="89"&gt;Cloud Run Jobs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;AI/ML Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect the application to Google's foundation models (Gemini) via &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,4,0" data-index-in-node="86"&gt;Vertex AI&lt;/strong&gt; to execute complex data extraction and automated risk assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Database Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,5,0" data-index-in-node="29"&gt;Firestore&lt;/strong&gt; for real-time application state management and metadata storage, while integrating &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,5,0" data-index-in-node="122"&gt;BigQuery&lt;/strong&gt; for heavy data warehousing and analytics workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,6,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,6,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Security &amp;amp; Authentication:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement enterprise-grade Single Sign-On (SSO) by configuring Google's &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,6,0" data-index-in-node="99"&gt;Identity-Aware Proxy (IAP)&lt;/strong&gt; and integrating it with &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,6,0" data-index-in-node="150"&gt;Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5,7,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,7,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and optimize deployment workflows using &lt;strong data-path-to-node="5,7,0" data-index-in-node="65"&gt;Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure seamless CI/CD pipelines into the GCP environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node="6"&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7"&gt;To be successful in this 12-week sprint, candidates must be able to hit the ground running with the following technologies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="8"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep proficiency in React and TypeScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong Python programming skills with hands-on FastAPI experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;GCP Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience with Google Cloud serverless architecture, specifically Cloud Run and Cloud Run Jobs.&lt;/p&gt;
